WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.767
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:02.767
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:03.901
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:04.667
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:05.801
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:08.434
The Biden administration
last week called

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:10.434
for new regulations
on regional banks.

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:13.167
I'm kidding. We're only
doing fun stuff today.

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:14.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:16.400
Regional banks.
Get outta here!

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:19.767
A Manhattan grand jury voted
on Thursday

00:00:19.767 --> 00:00:21.334
to indict former President Trump

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:23.534
for allegedly making
a hush money payment

00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:25.901
to adult film star
Stormy Daniels.

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:28.367
But if you think this is the end
for Donald Trump,

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:30.167
I have a bus to sell you.

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:32.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:34.667
After it was reported
on Thursday

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:37.501
that a Manhattan grand jury
had voted to indict him,

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:39.834
former President Trump
had dinner at Mar-a-Lago

00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:41.667
with former
First Lady Melania Trump.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.501
It was a poignant moment
in their relationship

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:47.467
and Trump and Melania
very tenderly and lovingly

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:48.767
split the check.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.567
[ As Trump ]
So, your half is $38.50.

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:54.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:56.601
Former President Trump
is set tomorrow

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:58.634
to be fingerprinted
and photographed

00:00:58.634 --> 00:01:01.067
and then the next step
will be to sit back

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:03.567
and see how many cold cases
that solves.

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:07.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:08.000
"We, uh --

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.901
[ Cheering ]

00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:14.067
Chief, you're not going
to believe this.

00:01:14.067 --> 00:01:16.300
We got news on the
Westchester Strangler.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.501 --> 00:01:20.634
Former President Trump's lawyers

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:22.501
are reportedly
considering asking

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:25.100
to have his trial moved
from Manhattan to Staten Island.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.934
Ah, yes, the Mar-a-Lago
of New York.

00:01:27.934 --> 00:01:29.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:30.501
What are they going
to sentence him to,

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:31.567
a parade?

00:01:31.567 --> 00:01:33.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.167
That's right,
Trump's lawyers want

00:01:34.167 --> 00:01:36.667
to have Trump's trial moved
from Manhattan to Staten Island.

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:38.200
Normally, if you want
to move something

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.133
from Manhattan to Staten Island,

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.901
you just throw it
in a trash can.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:46.300
Baze.

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:50.234
Alex -- make your letters
out to Alex Baze.

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:51.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:53.300
The Justice Department and FBI

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.334
reportedly have evidence
that former President Trump

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:57.267
possibly obstructed
the investigation

00:01:57.267 --> 00:02:00.267
into classified documents found
at his Mar-a-Lago home.

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:02.601
Trump is reportedly
still digesting the news

00:02:02.601 --> 00:02:03.834
and the documents.

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:07.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:10.501
A couple in Michigan recently
pulled into a Costco parking lot

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:12.067
to give birth to their baby

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:13.667
while on their way
to the hospital.

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:16.033
They also picked up
some snacks and toiletries

00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:19.734
because how often do you find
a parking space at Costco?

00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:21.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:21.834 --> 00:02:23.767
"Just breathe, honey,
I'm going to run in."

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:26.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.534 --> 00:02:29.534
Today with zoologist
Jane Goodall's 89th birthday.

00:02:29.534 --> 00:02:31.000
Her friends threw a party

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.133
and their feces.

00:02:32.133 --> 00:02:35.167
[ Laughter, oohs, and applause ]

00:02:37.067 --> 00:02:38.367
McDonald's --

00:02:38.367 --> 00:02:40.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:41.834
McDonald's has reportedly
closed down

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:43.334
its corporate offices
temporarily

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:45.667
to prepare for layoffs,
so, if you were looking

00:02:45.667 --> 00:02:48.000
to burglarize them,
now might be a good time.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:53.133
And, finally, today was Don't Go
to Work Unless It's Fun Day.

00:02:53.133 --> 00:02:55.234
But don't worry, it is.

00:02:55.234 --> 00:02:56.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:56.634 --> 00:02:57.968
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:02:57.968 --> 00:02:59.300
[ Cheering ]
We're off and running.

